      "id": "profanity_minor_002_01",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "うん、今の気持ちの温度は伝わった。",
      "displayText": "Mm, the temperature of that feeling came through.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_02",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "profanity_minor_002_02",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "でも、温度だけだと何を直せばいいか分からない。",
      "displayText": "But temperature alone does not tell me what needs fixing.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "profanity_minor_002_03",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "短くていいから、対象を教えて。作業？ 画面？ 自分？",
      "displayText": "Short is fine. Tell me the target: the work, the screen, yourself?",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "The task.",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_04"
        },
        {
          "label": "The system.",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_04"
        },
        {
          "label": "Me.",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_self"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "profanity_minor_002_self",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "自分に向いてるなら、少し弱めよう。自分を殴る言葉は、長く残るから。",
      "displayText": "If it is pointed at yourself, soften it a little. Words that hit you tend to stay.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_04",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "profanity_minor_002_04",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "そこからなら、ちゃんと一緒に見られる。",
      "displayText": "From there, I can properly look at it with you.",
